var px = new Uint8Array(w*h*4);
gl.readPixels(0,0,w,h,gl.RGBA,gl.UNSIGNED_BYTE,px);
// compute stats + draw to a 2D canvas scaled down, then toDataURL
```
Then I can get the dataURL out via dump-dom (base64 PNG) and decode it. That gives me a real image of what WebGL produced.

